d by mkp from examples/01-markdown-text/doc.mkp.md (sha256:877e046a9b52b5edc250a46353aef3fd4a98f376b590a6dd5608e267886b8ee4) -->\n\n# A trip to Lisbon\n\nLisbon sits on **seven hills** above the Tagus, and its trams are *still* the easiest way up.[^trams]\nThe [city's tourism office](https://www.visitlisboa.com) lists the main sights.\n\n## Before you go\n\n1. Check the tram timetable.\n2. Pack shoes for cobbles.\n3. Learn three words: *obrigado*, *bom dia*, *café*.\n\n## On the day\n\n- (done) Ride tram 28 to the castle\n- Watch the sunset from a *miradouro*[^view]\n- Eat a *pastel de nata* in Belém\n\n### Getting around\n\nMost neighbourhoods are walkable; the hills are the hard part.\n\n[^trams]: Tram 28 has run the same route since 1914.\n\n[^view]: A *miradouro* is a viewpoint; the city has more than twenty.\n","all":"<!-- generated by mkp from examples/01-markdown-text/doc.mkp.md (sha256:877e046a9b52b5edc250a46353aef3fd4a98f376b590a6dd5608e267886b8ee4) -->\n\n# A trip to Lisbon\n\nLisbon sits on **seven hills** above the Tagus, and its trams are *still* the easiest way up.[^trams]\nThe [city's tourism office](https://www.visitlisboa.com) lists the main sights.\n\n## Before you go\n\n1. Check the tram timetable.\n2. Pack shoes for cobbles.\n3. Learn three words: *obrigado*, *bom dia*, *café*.\n\n## On the day\n\n- [x] Ride tram 28 to the castle\n- [ ] Watch the sunset from a *miradouro*[^view]\n- [ ] Eat a *pastel de nata* in Belém\n\n### Getting around\n\nMost neighbourhoods are walkable; the hills are the hard part.\n\n[^trams]: Tram 28 has run the same route since 1914.\n\n[^view]: A *miradouro* is a viewpoint; the city has more than twenty.\n"}}